Sweeping Secular Resonance Solver

1. analytical_estimate.ipynb
    - Precession rates induced by disk potential and planet-planet interaction
    - Location and timeof secular resonances
2. rebound_prescribed_force.ipynb
    - Implementation of disk potential and Type 1 migration forces in REBOUND
3. rebound+SSR+type1_baseline.py
    - Example script to simulate the evolution of a two-planet system under the influence of disk potential and Type 1 migration forces
